<title>USA: Most IMM currencies finish moderately lower.</title>
<headline>Most IMM currencies finish moderately lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>Jan 21 - Most IMM currency futures ended lower after a session in negative territory amid stock and bond strength. Swiss leads losses, but marks lead volume, traders said. March marks, Swiss francs close above the contract lows at $0.6154 and $0.7077. Canadian dollar ends up on late surge after mostly lackluster day, trader said.</p>
<p>((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750/E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
